  "FLINK-15110": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-15110",
    "issue_type": "New Feature",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Support exclusions for variables",
    "description": "Tag-based reporters export all variables associated with a metric.\r\nThis behavior isn't configurable in any way, but may impact performance and stability. (see FLINK-13418)\r\n\r\nI propose to add a new configuration option {{metrics.reporter.<name>.scope.variables.excludes}} that includes a list of variables that should be excluded from the return value of {{MetricGroup#getAllVariables()}}.\r\n\r\nThis will implicitly cause all tag-based reporter from excluding these variables completely. In the future we can additionally look into separate options for controlling whether a variable should be exposed as indexed tags or not, if the backend supports this distinction.",
    "commits": [
      {
        "sha": "eb9cd5f36294f5809a68834eb7ce5ee7b8f292f2",
